<title>USA: Meridian Diagnostics sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Meridian Diagnostics sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Diagnostics Inc said on Monday it set a regular quarterly dividend of $0.035 per share and a special year-end cash dividend of $0.025.</p>
<p>Both dividends are to be paid December 6, 1996 to shareholders of record on November 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Meridian develops, manufactures and markets a variety of immunodiagnostic test kits.</p>
